      "id": "rouleaux",
      "name": "Rouleaux formation",
      "group": "Red cells",
      "look": "RBCs stack like coins, often dissolving with saline dispersion",
      "meaning": "May be physiologic in horses; increases with inflammatory proteins, not the same as true agglutination",
      "why": "Plasma protein changes promote reversible RBC stacking",
